    "pin": {
      "title": "Rothenburg ob der Tauber",
      "description": "Town in Bavaria, Germany",
      "extract": "Rothenburg ob der Tauber is a town in the district of Ansbach of Mittelfranken, in the Franconia region of Bavaria, Germany. It is best known for its well-preserved medieval old town, a destination for tourists from around the world. It is part of the popular Romantic Road through southern Germany. Today it is one of only four towns in Germany that still have completely intact city walls, the other three being Nördlingen, Dinkelsbühl and Berching, all in Bavaria.",
